stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AVAILABLE : Show Created & Seat Inventory Generated
    
    state "AVAILABLE (Ready for Hold)" as AVAILABLE
    state "HELD (Locked for 10 Mins)" as HELD
    state "CONFIRMED / BOOKED (Ticket Issued)" as CONFIRMED

    AVAILABLE --> HELD : Pessimistic Write Lock Acquired (holdSeats)
    HELD --> CONFIRMED : Booking Confirmed & Payment Succeeded
    HELD --> AVAILABLE : Hold Timer Expired / Cleaned
    HELD --> AVAILABLE : User Cancelled Hold
    CONFIRMED --> AVAILABLE : Booking Cancelled & Refunded

    CONFIRMED --> [*] : Show Concluded
